# WS6-02 (std.mem empty buffers). Sources: spec/appendix-stdlib.md §2 (bufferNew(size):
# allocates, `null` only on failure; bufferFrom(src): allocates and copies `src`;
# bufferLen: byte count) and C99 7.21.1p2 (no library call with an invalid pointer, even
# for zero length; checked by UBSan on the host line).
# Expected: "true 0 true 0 true 3", no sanitizer report.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: bufferFrom(slice<u8>(src, 0, 3)); ==> bufferFrom(slice<u8>(src, 1, 3));
contrast-expect: output
